<% content_for :title, "Terms of Service – StillOn" %>

<div class="sms-page">
  <div class="sms-shell">

    <div class="sms-header">
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p>Last updated: September 2026</p>
    </div>

    <section class="sms-section">
      <h2>The short version</h2>
      <p>StillOn helps friend groups keep recurring hangouts going. Organizers create hangouts and share invite links; guests RSVP. We send text reminders so nobody has to chase anyone. By using StillOn — as an organizer or a guest — you agree to these terms and our <%= link_to "Privacy Policy", privacy_path %>.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="sms-section">
      <h2>SMS terms</h2>
      <ul class="sms-list">
        <li><strong>Program:</strong> StillOn hangout reminders. Messages include verification codes, "Still on?" RSVP reminders, day-of reminders, and change or cancellation notices for hangouts you're part of.</li>
        <li><strong>Opting in:</strong> you only get texts if you enter your own phone number — when signing up as an organizer, or when you choose to add it on an RSVP page. We never text numbers entered by someone else. Consent is not a condition of any purchase.</li>
        <li><strong>Frequency:</strong> message frequency varies with your group's hangout schedule — typically one to three messages per hangout.</li>
        <li><strong>Cost:</strong> message and data rates may apply.</li>
        <li><strong>Opting out:</strong> reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message to stop all StillOn texts. You'll get one confirmation and nothing after. Reply <strong>START</strong> to resubscribe.</li>
        <li><strong>Help:</strong> reply <strong>HELP</strong> to any message, or email <strong>hello@stillon.app</strong>.</li>
        <li>Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>More detail on how opt-in works is on the <%= link_to "SMS Program page", sms_info_path %>.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="sms-section">
      <h2>Organizers</h2>
      <ul class="sms-list">
        <li>You're responsible for the hangouts you create and for sharing invite links only with people who'd want them.</li>
        <li>Invite links let anyone who has them view the hangout and RSVP. Don't post them publicly unless that's what you want.</li>
        <li>Keep your phone number current — it's how you sign in.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="sms-section">
      <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>Don't use StillOn to harass people, send spam, impersonate someone, or break the law. We may remove content or suspend accounts that do.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="sms-section">
      <h2>The service</h2>
      <p>StillOn is provided "as is." We work to keep it running and to deliver reminders on time, but we can't guarantee that every message arrives or that the service is always available. To the extent the law allows, we're not liable for missed hangouts or other indirect losses from using StillOn. We may change or discontinue features, and we may update these terms — if the changes are significant, we'll let organizers know.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="sms-section">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions? Reach us at <strong>hello@stillon.app</strong>.</p>
    </section>

  </div>
</div>
